p.minimal-taxonomy-lead 按主题整理的学习笔记。选择分类查看相关文章。
.minimal-category-grid
  each category in site.categories.data.filter(c => !c.parent).sort((a, b) => a.name.localeCompare(b.name))
    section.minimal-category-card
      a.minimal-category-title(href=url_for(category.path))
        span= category.name
        span.minimal-taxonomy-count #{category.length} 篇
      .minimal-category-children
        each child in site.categories.data.filter(c => c.parent === category._id).sort((a, b) => a.name.localeCompare(b.name))
          a(href=url_for(child.path))
            span= child.name
            span.minimal-taxonomy-count #{child.length} 篇 →
      .minimal-category-preview
        each article in category.posts.sort('date', -1).limit(3).data
          a(href=url_for(article.path))= article.title
